diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index c2e05e17cbb9fe1b0dda1a53b293eda68cd96f2c..b72d4356aa0c5a459ae72b4b3d2e3c4b61e7eee8 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -651,3 +651,14 @@ $config = [
 ];
 $ydb = new \YdbPlatform\Ydb\Ydb($config);
 ```
+
+### EDS discovery
+
+Set both `discovery` and `eds` to `true` when connecting through a managed
+discovery route. The PHP SDK retains one HTTP/2 connection to the bootstrap
+address. Before starting each service request it checks the subscription and
+rebinds existing service clients to the latest assignment. The PHP process
+processes a route change on its next request when it has been idle. A server
+that returns gRPC UNIMPLEMENTED uses unary discovery on the bootstrap
+connection. The transport supports the configured CA file and requires
+libcurl with HTTP/2 support and default gRPC channel options.
